  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The feral power within you grows: the natural weapons of your Form of the Beast count as magic weapons. You can also alter your form to adapt to your surroundings. When you finish a Short or Long Rest, choose one of the following benefits, which lasts until you finish your next Short or Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Amphibious.</strong> You gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed, and you can breathe underwater.</p><p><strong>Climber.</strong> You gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed, and you can climb difficult surfaces, including upside down on ceilings, without an ability check.</p><p><strong>Leaper.</strong> When you jump, you can make a Strength (Athletics) check and extend your jump by a number of feet equal to the check's total. You can make this special check only once per turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-B8nzAXxRTB2AD8Rv\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Turn on the effect of the benefit you chose (none for the jump).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
